# OrbitHold currently needs no environment variables to run or deploy.
#
# The frontend calls the API with relative paths (e.g. fetch("/api/predict")),
# and the trained model ships as a bundled JSON artifact
# (ml/models/model.json) read directly by the serverless functions in /api —
# there is no external database, auth provider, or third-party API key in
# this version.
#
# If you add one later (e.g. a hosted database for saving uploaded batches,
# or an auth provider), document the variable here and read it via
# process.env.YOUR_VAR_NAME in /api, or import.meta.env.VITE_YOUR_VAR_NAME
# in the frontend (Vite only exposes prefixed vars to client code).
